# MiniMax H3 clip from a face reference (Ref2VA, H3's own voice)

Generates a short clip of a character from a **face reference** and a **character sheet**. H3 also generates the voice and the sounds: there is no audio input.

In the FaceRefine Plus examples it is used twice:
- **step 1 of method B:** make the clip with the original face reference;
- **step 4 of method B:** make the SAME clip again from scratch, with the NEW face reference taken from the refined face. Use the same prompt and the same seed.

**Quality recipe** (the one the example assets were made with):
- pass 1: 20 steps at about 0.6 megapixels;
- H3 latent upscaler x1.3;
- pass 2: 4 refinement steps with the turbo LoRA;
- a light sharpen.

An 8 s clip (192 frames, 2 shots) took about 5-6 minutes on an RTX 5090 with the models already loaded (303-327 s in the example runs).

**Needs**
- the MiniMax H3 core nodes and models (Ref2VA hybrid int8 model, Qwen3-VL 32B text encoder, video/audio VAEs, turbo 4-step LoRA);
- Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler (github.com/LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler);
- comfyui-vrgamedevgirl for Fast Laplacian Sharpen (github.com/vrgamegirl19/comfyui-vrgamedevgirl). Optional: bypass it;
- ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite (Video Combine).

